{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且約今宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依律立法之意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵網付為邪見，亦是要令入大之意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "當知即是，此即大乘，及諸此字，\n畢竟指誰？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與天台五略暗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "莫知愚人非發心三誓註\n釋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上皆為自行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "化他行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "談法行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取以如前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有十境、十乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
